msgstr "Fizetési átjárók letiltása"

#: includes/class-wc-deposits-settings.php:211
msgid ""
"Select payment gateways that should be disabled when accepting deposits."
msgstr "Válassza ki azokat a fizetési átjárókat, amelyeket előleg elfogadásakor le kell tiltani."

#: includes/class-wc-deposits-settings.php:213
msgid ""
"Selected payment gateways will not be available as payment options when a "
"customer is making a deposit payment. This helps ensure compatibility with "
"payment methods that may not support partial payments."
